      "writtenOn": "2022-11-29T21:15:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My current thinking is it will be simpler and more scalable to just restart critical tasks as necessary. \n\nJumping to RW will cause a lot of memory to be overwritten. As we\u0027ve discussed, we can work around this by copying initialized memory to uninitialized memory before jumping, but this adds a lot of complexity.",
